{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05947","headline":"登楼歌 · 王维","name":"登楼歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"聊上君兮高楼，飞甍鳞次兮在下。\n俯十二兮通衢，绿槐参差兮车马。\n却瞻兮龙首，前眺兮宜春。\n王畿郁兮千里，山河壮兮咸秦。\n舍人下兮青宫，据胡牀兮书空。\n执戟疲於下位，老夫好隐兮墙东。\n亦幸有张伯英草圣兮龙腾蚪跃，摆长云兮捩回风。\n琥珀酒兮雕胡饭，君不御兮日将晚。\n秋风兮吹衣，夕鸟兮争返。\n孤砧发兮东城，林薄暮兮蝉声远。\n时不可兮再得，君何爲兮偃蹇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}